lls remain NOT_RUN pending credentials and authorization.\\\",\\\"ai_auto_assign remains False in persistent environments; enabling it there requires a separate operator decision after migration and concurrency evidence.\\\",\\\"Phone change, explicit WeChat rebind, controlled account merge, and high-risk real-name recovery remain tracked Production V1 gaps and must not be removed from the handoff.\\\",\\\"VIS-001..004 remain local visualization evidence only. Day 4 release and Production V1 PASS remain unverified.\\\"],\\\"session_note\\\":\\\"READY for independent source, migration-draft, UI, and test-authoring work. This review changed nothing and ran no tests or external services.\\\"}\\n{\\\"task_id\\\":\\\"AUTH-IDENTITY-AI-001\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"review\\\",\\\"reviewed_head\\\":\\\"38d3d09bf2e27154c4d106403cbfa9619026755a\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"NEEDS_CHANGES\\\",\\\"actions_or_findings\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Round-1 remediations 1-5 and 7 are present\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\",\\\"trigger\\\":\\\"Static inspection of the current working tree\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"OTP failures raise after the owned transaction; Redis uses one Lua INCR+EXPIRE operation and fails closed; WeChat bind requires sms/password; known bindings issue session-backed tokens; production admin creation rejects user_id; and app.json has no duplicate paths. Credential-auth 401 responses also preserve the existing session.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Concurrent 401 responses can invalidate a successful refresh\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\miniprogram\\\\\\\\services\\\\\\\\api.js\\\",\\\"trigger\\\":\\\"Two protected requests return 401 concurrently, such as the three-request Promise.all in pages/houses/houses.js\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Each request independently rotates the same refresh token. One succeeds, while the others receive refresh-replay failures and call sendUnauthorizedToLogin, clearing the newly rotated session. Refresh must be shared as one in-flight operation before each request retries once.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Employee claim does not lock the Employee row\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\backend\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\service\\\\\\\\employee_identity.py\\\",\\\"trigger\\\":\\\"An invite is claimed concurrently with an administrator disabling or otherwise updating the Employee\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"claim locks only EmployeeInvite and reads Employee through the unlocked get_employee method. The claim can validate ACTIVE, race with a status update, and still bind user_id and grant STAFF scopes. The authorized plan requires both invite and Employee locking before the status and unbound checks.\\\"}],\\\"evidence_paths\\\":[\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\reports\\\\\\\\project-handoff.md\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\reports\\\\\\\\auth-identity-ai-001\\\\\\\\evidence-boundary.md\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\reports\\\\\\\\auth-identity-ai-001\\\\\\\\schema-review.md\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\reports\\\\\\\\auth-identity-ai-001\\\\\\\\software-test-results.json\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\backend\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\service\\\\\\\\credential_auth.py\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\backend\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\core\\\\\\\\rate_limit.py\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\backend\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\api\\\\\\\\v1\\\\\\\\wechat_auth.py\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\backend\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\service\\\\\\\\wechat_auth.py\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\backend\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\api\\\\\\\\v1\\\\\\\\admin_employee.py\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\backend\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\service\\\\\\\\employee_identity.py\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\miniprogram\\\\\\\\services\\\\\\\\api.js\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\miniprogram\\\\\\\\pages\\\\\\\\houses\\\\\\\\houses.js\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\miniprogram\\\\\\\\app.json\\\",\\\"D:\\\\\\\\property-ai\\\\\\\\backend\\\\\\\\alembic\\\\\\\\versions\\\\\\\\20260